{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22121","headline":"酬杨九弘贞长安病中见寄 · 白居易","name":"酬杨九弘贞长安病中见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伏枕君寂寂，折腰我营营。\n所嗟经时别，相去一宿程。\n携手昨何时，昆明春水平。\n离郡来几日，太白夏云生。\n之子未得意，贫病客帝城。\n贫坚志士节，病长高人情。\n隐几自恬澹，闭门无送迎。\n龙卧心有待，鹤瘦貌弥清。\n清机发爲文，投我如振琼。\n何以慰饥渴，捧之吟一声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}